    "model": "PC (WOL + LAN shutdown)",
    "type": "other",
    "notes": "Wake uses the NIC MAC (enable WOL in BIOS). Shutdown: Windows RPC (user/password; Linux host needs samba-common-bin) or HTTP GET to auth.path on this device’s Port (small helper on the PC)."
